WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.585
I need a team of good agents.

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:04.337
But I just have
the Slow Horses.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:09.551
Alright make this quick.

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.678
I've got underlings
to bully. I’m busy.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.012
No one in
Slough House is busy.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:14.055
Come on, get on with it.

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:16.433
A team from MI5
has gone rogue… 

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.768
and Standish has
been taken.

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.020
What's the plan?

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:21.479
[pants zipped]

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:23.440
I need a team
of good agents.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.567
But I just have
the slow horses.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.236
And the traitors we’re
 looking for are ex-military.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.029
There will
be a reckoning.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:30.697
Go! Go!

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.700
You can wipe
your slate clean.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.743
Okay.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:36.369
There's another
game being played

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.246
that will probably
leave me worse off.

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:40.373
I just can't see
what this one is yet.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:41.583
[car alarm chirps]

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:44.043
It's an honor to be
selected for field work.

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:44.836
Shut up.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:45.253
Got it.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.131
Really?

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:51.718
Check the CCTV.

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:55.180
I'd be amazed if you
hadn't missed something.

00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:58.183
I still have oversight
of the slow horses.

00:00:58.183 --> 00:00:59.058
[guns click] 

00:00:59.058 --> 00:00:59.684
[car alarm chirps]

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:00.351
Lucky me.

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:02.228
♪

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:06.024
There are men
outside with guns.

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:07.734
Some backup
might be handy.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.568
Well, I'm busy.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.527
Okay. Thanks.

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:12.405
I'm sure the situation
will resolve itself.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.615
♪

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.200
MI5 betrayed us.

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:17.118
Justice is
coming their way.

00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:18.036
♪

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:19.329
We have to limit
the collateral damage.

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:21.331
Everyone in that facility

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:23.291
is coming out
in a body bag.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.211
-You’re smiling?
-Yeah. I feel alive, don’t you?

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:27.045
[gunshots]

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:29.380
♪

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.381
What would you have done?

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:31.591
I would have killed
every one of them.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.635
If they threatened to kill
you on the other hand

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:35.136
I’d buy 'em a
beer and the bullets.

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.262
[car door slams]
[sighs]

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.555
Go on, out you get.

00:01:37.555 --> 00:01:38.223
[sighs]

